        "# Docstring\n",
        "\n",
        "A docstring is a string literal appearing as the first statement in a module, class, function, or method. It documents the object and is available through `__doc__`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-docstring)"
      ]
    }
